<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss advertising pages drop 15 pct in March yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss advertising pages drop 15 pct in March yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advertising pages in Swiss newspapers fell 15.0 percent in March compared with a year earlier, according to figures compiled by the WEMF media tracking agency. The drop was 10.4 percent in the first quarter.</p>
<p>				  (pct change in pages vs year-ago)</p>
<p>						   Feb	Q1 1997</p>
<p> Daily/weekly newspapers		  -15.0	-10.4</p>
<p> Commercial ads			     -12.9	 -7.4</p>
<p>    Employment ads			  -30.3	-28.7</p>
<p> Free newspapers			    -13.6	 -5.9</p>
<p>    Commercial ads			  -11.8	 -3.0</p>
<p>    Employment ads			  -36.6	-38.7</p>
<p> Magazines				    -10.5	 -3.6</p>
<p>    Multicolour ads			  -6.8	 -0.4</p>
<p>    Black and white ads		   -20.2	-10.7</p>
<p> Specialised publications		 -17.0	-12.6</p>
<p>    Multicolour ads			 -14.5	 -3.3</p>
<p>    Black and white ads		   -18.1	-16.0</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
